  Ono Y., Yoshioka M., Taketsugu T. (2026). Zenodo deposit accompanying
  "Mapping Structured Absences in Scientific Papers: An Auditable LLM-Assisted
  Workflow Demonstrated on Cross-Coupling Chemistry" (UQS methodology,
  9-tier audit-trail organisation). GitHub: https://github.com/yurikoono/uqs-mapping-structured-absences
  Zenodo: concept DOI 10.5281/zenodo.23437447 (the revised deposit, all versions; files restricted
  to the editor and reviewers until acceptance)

If you adapt the prompts or methodology, please cite the underlying manuscript:

  Ono Y., Yoshioka M., Taketsugu T. "Mapping Structured Absences in Scientific
  Papers: An Auditable LLM-Assisted Workflow Demonstrated on Cross-Coupling
  Chemistry." Digital Discovery (2026, under revision (R1)).
